{"name": "Quack Hunters", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BECOME THE QUACK HUNTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252280/extras/a6e3c73c9da5f7386fb4ea33b490485d.poster.avif?t=1795703121\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252280/extras/a6e3c73c9da5f7386fb4ea33b490485d.webm?t=1795703121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252280/extras/a6e3c73c9da5f7386fb4ea33b490485d.mp4?t=1795703121\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A UFO abducted grandpa\u2019s goat and irradiated everything else in the forest. Team up with friends, grab the family guns and start hunting. After all these years, the ducks are finally the ones holding the guns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">YOUR TRUCK IS YOUR WEAPON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252280/extras/7d47c82668889323a9c39200e2366b48.poster.avif?t=1795703121\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252280/extras/7d47c82668889323a9c39200e2366b48.webm?t=1795703121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252280/extras/7d47c82668889323a9c39200e2366b48.mp4?t=1795703121\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One duck drives, one shoots from the passenger seat, one fires from the truck bed and the fourth runs around loading the haul. Hit the gas and run over anything slower than you. Including your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UPGRADE THE GEAR &amp; GUNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252280/extras/4f90d58ec1c1e6a23b8b02960a67cfde.poster.avif?t=1795703121\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252280/extras/4f90d58ec1c1e6a23b8b02960a67cfde.webm?t=1795703121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252280/extras/4f90d58ec1c1e6a23b8b02960a67cfde.mp4?t=1795703121\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every animal you bring back turns into cash, and every bit of cash turns into firepower. Upgrade your guns and your truck, then go after the beasts that laughed at your grandpa.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A 1-4 player physics-based hunting simulator. Aliens abducted your grandpa\u2019s beloved goat and irradiated everything else in the forest. To bring this goat home, you\u2019ll have to pick a gun and become a true Quack Hunter.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252280/d628f9b074dec18334867b3d55fe425fa252aca6/header.jpg?t=1795703121", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Multiplayer", "Online Co-Op", "Co-op", "Hunting", "Indie", "Shooter"], "developers": "Vampire Squid", "publishers": "Vampire Squid", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4252280", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "25 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/xHypDtI_Lfs", "first_seen": 1795561200.0, "review_rank": 14}